{"3837330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Power Grid Panic", "steam_appid": 3837330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the city’s last line of defense against the blackout. The old power manager quit during a storm, and now it’s your job to keep the lights on with nothing but frayed wires, half-working buildings, and a budget that wouldn’t power a toaster. Every day brings new demands, every night requires more power, and every season finds a new way to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t expect gratitude. Citizens complain about everything: the heat, the cold, outages — even pigeons on strike. You’ll juggle happiness, finances, and a grid that loves to set itself on fire, all while storms roll in and the economy collapses. The only help you’ll get is from questionable upgrades, like lightning rods, backup generators, or maybe just some help with the rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Grid Panic is a <strong>survival comedy</strong> where the question isn’t “can you build the perfect city?” but “how long can you delay inevitable disaster?” Each run plays differently, with random weather, and your own bad decisions combining into a blackout story worth telling. Three days, thirty days — or five minutes before the pigeons shut you down.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the city’s last line of defense against the blackout. The old power manager quit during a storm, and now it’s your job to keep the lights on with nothing but frayed wires, half-working buildings, and a budget that wouldn’t power a toaster. Every day brings new demands, every night requires more power, and every season finds a new way to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t expect gratitude. Citizens complain about everything: the heat, the cold, outages — even pigeons on strike. You’ll juggle happiness, finances, and a grid that loves to set itself on fire, all while storms roll in and the economy collapses. The only help you’ll get is from questionable upgrades, like lightning rods, backup generators, or maybe just some help with the rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Grid Panic is a <strong>survival comedy</strong> where the question isn’t “can you build the perfect city?” but “how long can you delay inevitable disaster?” Each run plays differently, with random weather, and your own bad decisions combining into a blackout story worth telling. Three days, thirty days — or five minutes before the pigeons shut you down.</p>", "short_description": "A survival comedy where every storm, outage, and pigeon is out to end your career. Upgrade, panic, and try to keep the lights on a little longer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/3fb035a34f17277eccf53321af322b288ca4c614/header.jpg?t=1762647953", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/15b3952f8d5e4f90cd9c4f672561227cf634d6df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762647953", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837330/15b3952f8d5e4f90cd9c4f672561227cf634d6df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762647953", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeon HD 7770 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound